<title>UK: NTL Inc plans EASDAQ float in July.</title>
<headline>NTL Inc plans EASDAQ float in July.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecoms and cable broadcasting group NTL Inc said on Friday it was planning a listing on the pan-European EASDAQ stock market in early July.</p>
<p>The group would become the twelfth company to list on the Brussels-based stock exchange which started trading in November last year.</p>
<p>NTL is already quoted on the NASDAQ exchange and has a market capitalisation of $800 million.</p>
<p>No further details were immediately available from the company.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 3496</p>
